5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to see you all. I wonder if we might look into how our dear staff and volunteers are faring these days?,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"A sentimental start, Shizue. I prefer a more clinical approach. We need to identify the actual points of failure in our logistics.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"Oh, you two are so serious! Let's not forget the most important part: the people who actually pay for the tickets. What do they really think?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I agree we need data. However, I am concerned about the physical limits of the gallery itself. We cannot ignore the building's capacity.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! A mystery! I want to know where all the money goes! It's like a treasure hunt, but the treasure is already gone!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Hehe, Sakura is always so energetic. I think it would be wise to see who is available to help us bring these visions to life.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Sakura, ""treasure hunting"" is hardly a strategy. If we want a successful season, we must look at the paperwork and the shipping cut-offs.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shion, you're such a killjoy. I'm more interested in the numbers. I want to see who actually showed up on the weekends.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, numbers are useful, but they don't tell us if the floor can hold the weight of the exhibits.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, you're just grumpy! I'm going to find the secret money-eating monsters! I bet it's the fancy boxes or the trucks!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"Now, now, let's be kind to one another. I shall look into the staffing and the volunteers to ensure no one is overworked.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'll stick to the logistics. I want to see where the delivery process actually broke down in the past.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"I've made up my mind. I'm going for the visitor comments and the head counts. Let's see if our ""masterpieces"" were actually hits.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will investigate the structural survey and the maintenance logs. We need to know the building's current state.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm picking the transport costs and the mount-making charges! I'll catch those money-monsters red-handed!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
